findings.comment:
750.800e - The following non-food contact surfaces were soiled;
A) bottom inside 2 door freezer (debris);
B) dust pan under handsink in back of facility (grimy buildup); 
C) cabinet under food counter handsink (moisture/buildup);
D) cabinet under slushi machines (splash) - cleaned during inspection;
E) under cheese sauce dispenser and condiment cold holding container (dust/debris).

Clean non-food contact surfaces daily/as needed to eliminate buildup of debris.

findings.citation_text:
750.1220 - Floors were soiled in the following areas with general debris and/or splash:
A) under/around the 3 part sink and grease trap;
B) under the 2 door freezer;
C) under the ice machine;  and
D) under in-use soda syrup by walkin cooler door.

Floors shall be maintained clean. Clean the floors under/around equipment daily/as needed to eliminate buildup of debris.

findings.comment:
750.800e - The following non-food contact surfaces were soiled:
A) mopsink basin (grimy buildup);
B) bottom inside 2 door freezer (food/cardboard debris);
C) walkin cooler shelving (food splash - shelving to the right of entrance used for food storage);
D) counter under condiments and cheese sauce (dust/food debris);
E) plastic containers used for storage under coffee counter (general buildup);  and
F) doughnut case - bottom inside and storage compartments directly beneath doughnuts (food debris & dust).

Clean non-food contact surfaces daily/as needed to eliminate buildup of debris.

findings.citation_text:
