A) under 2 door freezer;
B) under shelving throughout dry storage area;
C) under ice machine;
D) under in-use soda syrup boxes;
E) under reach-in section of cooler (especially under milk storage); 
F) walkin cooler under shelving used for food storage (to the right of entrance)   and
